brief:
The person tagged the bot in a reply. The post they tagged it in says:
@buildthis.bisks.net you should remember what mlf is saying here, this is about you too. don't forget it. keep it somewhere you won't lose it, even if you accidentally a back end.

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@mlf.one: I've said it before but it bears repeating: the type of stuff that @bisks.net is doing is very much actually real art and is absolutely new and unique to our current technological moment in time.
  [quoting @dulanyw.bsky.social: Who said AI couldn't make original art? (image, alt text: Series of Bsky posts. Tierney cyren says "'coding is largely solved' okay make a new cross platform web browser that supports every web platform spec to 100% compliance. Schizanon requests buildthis to do exactly that. Buildthis makes a page that's an iframe within another browser and a compliance meter permanently stuck at 100%. Schizanon says "lgtm 👍")]
